---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy — Güven Gürsel">
  <section class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-title">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">
      Data protection notice under Article 13 GDPR.
      Last updated: 21 April 2026.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-prose">
    <h2>Data controller</h2>
    <p>
      Güven Gürsel<br />
      {'Feldstraße 18'}<br />
      {'4072, Straßham'}, Austria<br />
      <a href="mailto:contact@guvengursel.com">contact@guvengursel.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing beyond what is strictly necessary to serve the
      page. No analytics, no tracking pixels, no advertising
      networks, no third-party scripts that observe your
      behaviour.
    </p>

    <h2>Server logs</h2>
    <p>
      This website is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare,
      as data processor, automatically records standard server
      access data (timestamp, IP address, user agent, requested
      URL, HTTP status) for operational, security, and
      abuse-prevention purposes. Cloudflare's retention and
      processing policies apply:
      <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cloudflare.com/privacypolicy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Local storage</h2>
    <p>
      Your browser stores a single key named <code>theme</code>
      in local storage when you manually switch the colour
      theme. This value stays on your device and is never
      transmitted to a server. You can delete it at any time
      via your browser settings. It is strictly necessary for
      maintaining your display preference and does not require
      consent.
    </p>

    <h2>Self-hosted fonts</h2>
    <p>
      All fonts are delivered from this same domain. No
      requests are made to Google Fonts, Google CDN, or any
      third party for font delivery.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This website sets no cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact by email</h2>
    <p>
      When you email the address above, your message and
      sender address are processed solely to respond to your
      enquiry. Messages are retained only as long as necessary
      to handle the matter.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights under GDPR</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to access (Art 15), rectification
      (Art 16), erasure (Art 17), data portability (Art 20),
      and objection (Art 21). You may also lodge a complaint
      with the Austrian Data Protection Authority
      (Datenschutzbehörde, Barichgasse 40-42, 1030 Wien,
      <a href="mailto:dsb@dsb.gv.at">dsb@dsb.gv.at</a>).
      To exercise these rights toward this site, contact the
      data controller above.
    </p>

    <h2>Jurisdiction</h2>
    <p>
      Austrian law applies.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
